  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-journal-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-journal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-journal-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo_Forge-213f5c?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=3d215c\"></a>\n</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Loot Journal 是一款客戶端模組，透過流暢的動畫通知、智能堆疊與完整的視覺自訂功能來增強物品拾取體驗。即時追蹤您與附近玩家的拾取紀錄，在遊戲內微調每個細節，享受乾淨且沉浸式的介面。</h2>\n<p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Rn2RuE.png\"></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u0aVYsI.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">流暢的拾取流程</h1>\n        <p>乾淨俐落的動畫拾取通知會從螢幕邊緣自然滑入，與遊戲畫面完美融合。智能的堆疊、合併與定位邏輯確保資訊清晰易讀，特殊效果則能突顯稀有掉落。完整支援物品與經驗值。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">視覺主題</h1>\n        <p>提供多種內建視覺主題供您選擇，各主題擁有獨特的風格與版面配置。每個主題皆可單獨微調，亦可透過資源包新增全新主題，賦予您完全的視覺自由。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1613/690/lj1-jpg.jpg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iup6WPg.gif\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">玩家追蹤</h1>\n        <p>即時查看附近玩家正在拾取的物品。追蹤好友、發現稀有掉落，或監控周遭動態。支援完整設定與玩家過濾功能——玩家也可利用隱形效果或雕刻南瓜頭隱藏自己。完全適用於原版伺服器！</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">遊戲內設定</h1>\n        <p>完全開放且直覺易懂的設定系統，讓您能精細調整模組的每個層面。直接在遊戲中調整版面配置、位置、動畫、音效與過濾條件，並即時預覽變更。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1612/362/4-jpg.jpg\" width=\"60%\">\n</div>\n<p><br>\n<hr>\n<br></p>\n<div style=\"display:flex\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1612/363/5-jpg.jpg\" width=\"60%\">\n    <div>⠀⠀</div>\n    <div>\n        <h1 style=\"font-weight:bold\">精緻的介面細節</h1>\n        <p>專為清晰度與舒適度設計。更新時條目會閃爍提示，大量拾取事件會自動整併統計，總數量追蹤功能更涵蓋潛影盒、麻布袋與其他容器內的物品。所有機制協同運作，讓您的螢幕資訊豐富卻不顯雜亂。</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img width=\"90%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZBaOT4.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AWVa1rL.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0F3Uyq.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillager-caravans\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lPK6BrB.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-elixirum\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zMZKr3b.png\" width=\"45%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\"></a> \n  <img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjJSLI0.png\" width=\"45%\">\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4lV9g9R.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Y7y8mO.png\" width=\"90%\"></a>\n</p>",
